hitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">6.103</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">5.537</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">30 anni</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">5.521</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">4.767</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">4.120</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted">Potere d''acquisto in euro di oggi, con un''inflazione costante ogni anno.</p></figure>'),
